WEBVTT

00:14:29.395 --> 00:14:34.195
it's being deployed
in many more places in China,

00:14:34.219 --> 00:14:36.886
for example, it's being deployed
in the classroom.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.577
CA: Tell me a bit more about that,

00:14:38.601 --> 00:14:40.148
because that sounds both amazing

00:14:40.172 --> 00:14:42.703
and a little scary
to some people, I suspect.

00:14:42.727 --> 00:14:45.436
So you've got a camera
at the front of the classroom

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.392
that's looking at the class.

00:14:47.765 --> 00:14:51.127
And taking note of
which kids are paying attention?

00:14:51.598 --> 00:14:53.019
KFL: There are multiple uses.

00:14:53.043 --> 00:14:56.371
So first, there is the within-class use.

00:14:56.395 --> 00:14:58.888
So there is a physical teacher
in the classroom,

00:14:58.912 --> 00:15:00.188
and there are students.